[{"id":"fariha-6-44-12","words":["verb:fariha"],"options":[{"bs":"radovali su se","en":"they rejoiced"},{"bs":"neka se raduju","en":"let them rejoice"},{"bs":"raduje se","en":"he/it rejoices"},{"bs":"radujete se","en":"you (all) rejoice"}],"ref":"6:44","answerWord":"فَرِحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/9182ae9a5e05806d1c8f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, when they forgot that whereof they had been reminded, We opened unto them the gates of all things till, even as they were rejoicing in that which they were given, We seized them unawares, and lo! they were dumbfounded.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"radovati se","en":"to rejoice, to be glad"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","نَسُوا۟","مَا","ذُكِّرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَتَحْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","أَبْوَٰبَ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","فَرِحُوا۟","بِمَآ","أُوتُوٓا۟","أَخَذْنَٰهُم","بَغْتَةً","فَإِذَا","هُم","مُّبْلِسُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"فَرِحَ"}},{"id":"fariha-3-188-3","words":["verb:fariha"],"options":[{"bs":"raduju se","en":"they rejoice"},{"bs":"raduje se","en":"he/it rejoices"},{"bs":"i radovali su se","en":"and they rejoiced"},{"bs":"radujete se","en":"you (all) rejoice"}],"ref":"3:188","answerWord":"يَفْرَحُونَ","answerSound":"audio/bfbb7d34bc6e021edfbe.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Think not that those who exult in what they have given, and love to be praised for what they have not done - Think not, they are in safety from the doom. A painful doom is theirs.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"radovati se","en":"to rejoice, to be glad"},"passage":["لَا","تَحْسَبَنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَفْرَحُونَ","بِمَآ","أَتَوا۟","وَّيُحِبُّونَ","أَن","يُحْمَدُوا۟","بِمَا","لَمْ","يَفْعَلُوا۟","فَلَا","تَحْسَبَنَّهُم","بِمَفَازَةٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"فَرِحَ"}},{"id":"fariha-9-81-0","words":["verb:fariha"],"options":[{"bs":"radovao se","en":"he/it rejoiced"},{"bs":"radujete se","en":"you (all) rejoice"},{"bs":"raduju se","en":"they rejoice"},{"bs":"radovali su se","en":"they rejoiced"}],"ref":"9:81","answerWord":"فَرِحَ","answerSound":"audio/97b1e08cc0b2a8618b5d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who were left behind rejoiced at sitting still behind the messenger of Allah, and were averse to striving with their wealth and their lives in Allah's way. And they said: Go not forth in the heat! Say: The fire of hell is more intense of heat, if they but understood.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"radovati se","en":"to rejoice, to be glad"},"passage":["فَرِحَ","ٱلْمُخَلَّفُونَ","بِمَقْعَدِهِمْ","خِلَٰفَ","رَسُولِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَكَرِهُوٓا۟","أَن","يُجَٰهِدُوا۟","بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","وَأَنفُسِهِمْ","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَقَالُوا۟","لَا","تَنفِرُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْحَرِّ","قُلْ","نَارُ","جَهَنَّمَ","أَشَدُّ","حَرًّا","لَّوْ","كَانُوا۟","يَفْقَهُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"فَرِحَ"}},{"id":"fariha-40-75-3","words":["verb:fariha"],"options":[{"bs":"radujete se","en":"you (all) rejoice"},{"bs":"neka se raduju","en":"let them rejoice"},{"bs":"radovali su se","en":"they rejoiced"},{"bs":"raduje se","en":"he/it rejoices"}],"ref":"40:75","answerWord":"تَفْرَحُونَ","answerSound":"audio/f51873385e3e21e77476.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(And it is said unto them): This is because ye exulted in the earth without right, and because ye were petulant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"radovati se","en":"to rejoice, to be glad"},"passage":["ذَٰلِكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَفْرَحُونَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","بِغَيْرِ","ٱلْحَقِّ","وَبِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَمْرَحُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"فَرِحَ"}},{"id":"fariha-3-120-7","words":["verb:fariha"],"options":[{"bs":"raduju se","en":"they rejoice"},{"bs":"radovali su se","en":"they rejoiced"},{"bs":"radovao se","en":"he/it rejoiced"},{"bs":"radujete se","en":"you (all) rejoice"}],"ref":"3:120","answerWord":"يَفْرَحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/e41e0a858dee20ada3bd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If a lucky chance befall you, it is evil unto them, and if disaster strike you they rejoice thereat. But if ye persevere and keep from evil their guile will never harm you. Lo! Allah is Surrounding what they do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"radovati se","en":"to rejoice, to be glad"},"passage":["إِن","تَمْسَسْكُمْ","حَسَنَةٌ","تَسُؤْهُمْ","وَإِن","تُصِبْكُمْ","سَيِّئَةٌ","يَفْرَحُوا۟","بِهَا","وَإِن","تَصْبِرُوا۟","وَتَتَّقُوا۟","لَا","يَضُرُّكُمْ","كَيْدُهُمْ","شَيْـًٔا","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","بِمَا","يَعْمَلُونَ","مُحِيطٌ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"فَرِحَ"}},{"id":"fariha-10-58-5","words":["verb:fariha"],"options":[{"bs":"neka se raduju","en":"let them rejoice"},{"bs":"radovao se","en":"he/it rejoiced"},{"bs":"radujete se","en":"you (all) rejoice"},{"bs":"raduje se","en":"he/it rejoices"}],"ref":"10:58","answerWord":"فَلْيَفْرَحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/233f0c0664032a40a887.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: In the bounty of Allah and in His mercy: therein let them rejoice. It is better than what they hoard.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"radovati se","en":"to rejoice, to be glad"},"passage":["قُلْ","بِفَضْلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَبِرَحْمَتِهِۦ","فَبِذَٰلِكَ","فَلْيَفْرَحُوا۟","هُوَ","خَيْرٌ","مِّمَّا","يَجْمَعُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"فَرِحَ"}},{"id":"fariha-30-4-10","words":["verb:fariha"],"options":[{"bs":"raduje se","en":"he/it rejoices"},{"bs":"radujete se","en":"you (all) rejoice"},{"bs":"neka se raduju","en":"let them rejoice"},{"bs":"radovali su se","en":"they rejoiced"}],"ref":"30:4","answerWord":"يَفْرَحُ","answerSound":"audio/5373b1671a6e76162c1a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Within ten years - Allah's is the command in the former case and in the latter - and in that day believers will rejoice","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"radovati se","en":"to rejoice, to be glad"},"passage":["فِى","بِضْعِ","سِنِينَ","لِلَّهِ","ٱلْأَمْرُ","مِن","قَبْلُ","وَمِنۢ","بَعْدُ","وَيَوْمَئِذٍ","يَفْرَحُ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"فَرِحَ"}},{"id":"fariha-57-23-6","words":["verb:fariha"],"options":[{"bs":"radujete se","en":"you (all) rejoice"},{"bs":"raduju se","en":"they rejoice"},{"bs":"radovali su se","en":"they rejoiced"},{"bs":"radovao se","en":"he/it rejoiced"}],"ref":"57:23","answerWord":"تَفْرَحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/f82a85889a7c83045816.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That ye grieve not for the sake of that which hath escaped you, nor yet exult because of that which hath been given. Allah loveth not all prideful boasters,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"radovati se","en":"to rejoice, to be glad"},"passage":["لِّكَيْلَا","تَأْسَوْا۟","عَلَىٰ","مَا","فَاتَكُمْ","وَلَا","تَفْرَحُوا۟","بِمَآ","ءَاتَىٰكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","كُلَّ","مُخْتَالٍ","فَخُورٍ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"فَرِحَ"}},{"id":"ibtala-89-16-3","words":["verb:ibtala"],"options":[{"bs":"iskuša ga","en":"He tries him"},{"bs":"da vas iskuša","en":"so that he/it may test you (all)"},{"bs":"i iskušajte!","en":"and (you all) test!"},{"bs":"iskušao je","en":"he/it tested"}],"ref":"89:16","answerWord":"ٱبْتَلَىٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/20428425cc141fafdfd7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But whenever He trieth him by straitening his means of life, he saith: My Lord despiseth me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, provjeriti","en":"to test, to try"},"passage":["وَأَمَّآ","إِذَا","مَا","ٱبْتَلَىٰهُ","فَقَدَرَ","عَلَيْهِ","رِزْقَهُۥ","فَيَقُولُ","رَبِّىٓ","أَهَٰنَنِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَلَى"}},{"id":"ibtala-2-124-1","words":["verb:ibtala"],"options":[{"bs":"iskušao je","en":"he/it tested"},{"bs":"i da iskuša","en":"and so that he/it may test"},{"bs":"iskušavamo ga","en":"We test him"},{"bs":"i iskušajte!","en":"and (you all) test!"}],"ref":"2:124","answerWord":"ٱبْتَلَىٰٓ","answerSound":"audio/03b069a70f28343be753.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when his Lord tried Abraham with (His) commands, and he fulfilled them, He said: Lo! I have appointed thee a leader for mankind. (Abraham) said: And of my offspring (will there be leaders)? He said: My covenant includeth not wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, provjeriti","en":"to test, to try"},"passage":["وَإِذِ","ٱبْتَلَىٰٓ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمَ","رَبُّهُۥ","بِكَلِمَٰتٍ","فَأَتَمَّهُنَّ","قَالَ","إِنِّى","جَاعِلُكَ","لِلنَّاسِ","إِمَامًا","قَالَ","وَمِن","ذُرِّيَّتِى","قَالَ","لَا","يَنَالُ","عَهْدِى","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَلَى"}},{"id":"ibtala-33-11-1","words":["verb:ibtala"],"options":[{"bs":"iskušan je","en":"he/it was tested"},{"bs":"iskušavamo ga","en":"We test him"},{"bs":"da vas iskuša","en":"so that he/it may test you (all)"},{"bs":"i iskušajte!","en":"and (you all) test!"}],"ref":"33:11","answerWord":"ٱبْتُلِىَ","answerSound":"audio/70259070763525cbf052.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There were the believers sorely tried, and shaken with a mighty shock.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, provjeriti","en":"to test, to try"},"passage":["هُنَالِكَ","ٱبْتُلِىَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","وَزُلْزِلُوا۟","زِلْزَالًا","شَدِيدًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَلَى"}},{"id":"ibtala-76-2-6","words":["verb:ibtala"],"options":[{"bs":"iskušavamo ga","en":"We test him"},{"bs":"i iskušajte!","en":"and (you all) test!"},{"bs":"iskuša ga","en":"He tries him"},{"bs":"da vas iskuša","en":"so that he/it may test you (all)"}],"ref":"76:2","answerWord":"نَّبْتَلِيهِ","answerSound":"audio/f29b48fed784a94af0dd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We create man from a drop of thickened fluid to test him; so We make him hearing, knowing.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, provjeriti","en":"to test, to try"},"passage":["إِنَّا","خَلَقْنَا","ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ","مِن","نُّطْفَةٍ","أَمْشَاجٍ","نَّبْتَلِيهِ","فَجَعَلْنَٰهُ","سَمِيعًۢا","بَصِيرًا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَلَى"}},{"id":"zagha-9-117-16","words":["verb:zagha"],"options":[{"bs":"skreće","en":"he/it swerves"},{"bs":"skrenuli su","en":"they swerved"},{"bs":"skrenula je","en":"she/it swerved"},{"bs":"skrenuo je","en":"swerved"}],"ref":"9:117","answerWord":"يَزِيغُ","answerSound":"audio/2b9ecb3fd5d3507b833e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah hath turned in mercy to the Prophet, and to the Muhajirin and the Ansar who followed him in the hour of hardship. After the hearts of a party of them had almost swerved aside, then turned He unto them in mercy. Lo! He is Full of Pity, Merciful for them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skrenuti, zastraniti","en":"to swerve, to deviate"},"passage":["لَّقَد","تَّابَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَى","ٱلنَّبِىِّ","وَٱلْمُهَٰجِرِينَ","وَٱلْأَنصَارِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّبَعُوهُ","فِى","سَاعَةِ","ٱلْعُسْرَةِ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","كَادَ","يَزِيغُ","قُلُوبُ","فَرِيقٍ","مِّنْهُمْ","ثُمَّ","تَابَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","إِنَّهُۥ","بِهِمْ","رَءُوفٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"زاغَ"}},{"id":"zagha-33-10-8","words":["verb:zagha"],"options":[{"bs":"skrenula je","en":"she/it swerved"},{"bs":"skreće","en":"he/it swerves"},{"bs":"skrenuo je","en":"swerved"},{"bs":"skrenuli su","en":"they swerved"}],"ref":"33:10","answerWord":"زَاغَتِ","answerSound":"audio/502f669bc35df4440b29.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When they came upon you from above you and from below you, and when eyes grew wild and hearts reached to the throats, and ye were imagining vain thoughts concerning Allah.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skrenuti, zastraniti","en":"to swerve, to deviate"},"passage":["إِذْ","جَآءُوكُم","مِّن","فَوْقِكُمْ","وَمِنْ","أَسْفَلَ","مِنكُمْ","وَإِذْ","زَاغَتِ","ٱلْأَبْصَٰرُ","وَبَلَغَتِ","ٱلْقُلُوبُ","ٱلْحَنَاجِرَ","وَتَظُنُّونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلظُّنُونَا۠"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"زاغَ"}},{"id":"zagha-34-12-19","words":["verb:zagha"],"options":[{"bs":"skreće","en":"he/it swerves"},{"bs":"skrenuo je","en":"swerved"},{"bs":"skrenula je","en":"she/it swerved"},{"bs":"skrenuli su","en":"they swerved"}],"ref":"34:12","answerWord":"يَزِغْ","answerSound":"audio/f924a4f4cf75df36581c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And unto Solomon (We gave) the wind, whereof the morning course was a month's journey and the evening course a month's journey, and We caused the fount of copper to gush forth for him, and (We gave him) certain of the jinn who worked before him by permission of his Lord. And such of them as deviated from Our command, them We caused to taste the punishment of flaming Fire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skrenuti, zastraniti","en":"to swerve, to deviate"},"passage":["وَلِسُلَيْمَٰنَ","ٱلرِّيحَ","غُدُوُّهَا","شَهْرٌ","وَرَوَاحُهَا","شَهْرٌ","وَأَسَلْنَا","لَهُۥ","عَيْنَ","ٱلْقِطْرِ","وَمِنَ","ٱلْجِنِّ","مَن","يَعْمَلُ","بَيْنَ","يَدَيْهِ","بِإِذْنِ","رَبِّهِۦ","وَمَن","يَزِغْ","مِنْهُمْ","عَنْ","أَمْرِنَا","نُذِقْهُ","مِنْ","عَذَابِ","ٱلسَّعِيرِ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"زاغَ"}},{"id":"zagha-38-63-3","words":["verb:zagha"],"options":[{"bs":"skrenula je","en":"she/it swerved"},{"bs":"skrenuo je","en":"swerved"},{"bs":"skrenuli su","en":"they swerved"},{"bs":"skreće","en":"he/it swerves"}],"ref":"38:63","answerWord":"زَاغَتْ","answerSound":"audio/d265daf8b01519731646.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Did we take them (wrongly) for a laughing-stock, or have our eyes missed them?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skrenuti, zastraniti","en":"to swerve, to deviate"},"passage":["أَتَّخَذْنَٰهُمْ","سِخْرِيًّا","أَمْ","زَاغَتْ","عَنْهُمُ","ٱلْأَبْصَٰرُ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"زاغَ"}},{"id":"zagha-53-17-1","words":["verb:zagha"],"options":[{"bs":"skrenuo je","en":"swerved"},{"bs":"skrenula je","en":"she/it swerved"},{"bs":"skreće","en":"he/it swerves"},{"bs":"skrenuli su","en":"they swerved"}],"ref":"53:17","answerWord":"زَاغَ","answerSound":"audio/bcaa1f5a733283af935a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The eye turned not aside nor yet was overbold.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skrenuti, zastraniti","en":"to swerve, to deviate"},"passage":["مَا","زَاغَ","ٱلْبَصَرُ","وَمَا","طَغَىٰ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"زاغَ"}},{"id":"zagha-61-5-14","words":["verb:zagha"],"options":[{"bs":"skrenuli su","en":"they swerved"},{"bs":"skrenula je","en":"she/it swerved"},{"bs":"skrenuo je","en":"swerved"},{"bs":"skreće","en":"he/it swerves"}],"ref":"61:5","answerWord":"زَاغُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/a53350cee96cfc81d09c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when Moses said unto his people: O my people! Why persecute ye me, when ye well know that I am Allah's messenger unto you? So when they went astray Allah sent their hearts astray. And Allah guideth not the evil-living folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skrenuti, zastraniti","en":"to swerve, to deviate"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","لِقَوْمِهِۦ","يَٰقَوْمِ","لِمَ","تُؤْذُونَنِى","وَقَد","تَّعْلَمُونَ","أَنِّى","رَسُولُ","ٱللَّهِ","إِلَيْكُمْ","فَلَمَّا","زَاغُوٓا۟","أَزَاغَ","ٱللَّهُ","قُلُوبَهُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلْفَٰسِقِينَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"زاغَ"}}]